{"version":1,"content":"<p>【轉向 Arm ... 😱】外媒報導，傳 AMD 將會推出入門級 ARM 處理器進軍 Windows on ARM 市場，預計於 2027 年第二季與 Microsoft 聯手，應用於 12 吋入門級 Surface 機型以及商用雲端 PC 裝置「Windows 365 Link」。</p><p>連傳統 x86 大廠也不得不導入 Arm 架構處理器，令 x86 處理器的未來處境更顯劣勢。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:23:56.666953+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:37:45.748128+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:18:08.676728+00:00","content_hash":"877673b806f91043e64b46f760dc50661bfbf595dd837ae62a13002179a87998","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}